## Retired task lists

Legacy todo lists, archives, and habit lists were removed as stale by request.
Do not reconstruct them from history or create replacement task files without an
explicit request. Do not archive into the deleted lists. Existing inbox, journals,
and schedules are historical context, not automatically current task queues.

